ng moments came from a new hampshire  teenager  hi my name is braden harrington and i'm  13 years old  and without joe biden i wouldn't be  talking to you today  brayden met biden in february seeking  advice about something biden struggled  with as a young man  a stutter you're going to see this kid  become president united states of  america someday  six months later brayden had a global  platform  kids like me are counting on you to  elect someone  we can all look up to now the rest is up  to biden  but while i'll be a democratic candidate  i will be an  american president  and just 15 minutes ago a brand new  biden interview conducted this afternoon  here in wilmington dropped  abc news asked him if he would shut the  country down  during a covent spike if that was what  scientists recommended biden said this  quote  i would shut it down i would listen to  the scientists  and that represents yet another  clear-cut difference between biden  and trump about one of the issues that  voters care about  the most right now brett peter ducey  live in wilmington peter thanks more on  this with the panels
 

